[LESSON]: Temporal mapping in Alloy 6 must be done via explicit bijection (e.g., s.time = t) and not by arbitrary set comprehensions.
[EVENT]: Added time: one Time field to SystemState and fact TimeStateBijection to enforce a bijection between Time and SystemState.
[EVENT]: Replaced invalid systemStateAt with the snapshot function using the new bijection idiom.
